<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK JULY NET 37 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK JULY NET 37 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>July 1997.</p>
<p>				   (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net income		     37		 vs not given</p>
<p>BALANCE SHEET</p>
<p> Total assets		   9.04 billion   vs 7.62 billion</p>
<p> Demand deposits		3.41 billion   vs 3.19 billion</p>
<p> Time deposits		  2.28 billion   vs 1.18 billion</p>
<p> Loans			    4.28 billion   vs 4.20 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparisons for leading bank Hansapank are with June</p>
<p>1997.</p>
<p>The bank also said that its return on equity at the end of</p>
<p>July was 47.91 percent, return on assets was 5.65 percent, the</p>
<p>net interest margin was 5.27 percent and the net non-interest</p>
<p>margin was 3.16 percent.</p>
<p>It said its banking share was 26 percent in terms of assets,</p>
<p>24.7 percent in deposits and 26.5 percent in loans.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/reuter@reuter.ee</p>
